language Essence 1.3

$ Range contains the actual images, not the keys or the whole codomain.
$ Repeated images count once in the sum; an empty partial function has an empty range.
find f : function (total) int(10,20) --> int(1..2)
find bound : int(0..3)
find has_one, has_two : bool
such that
    sum([v | v <- range(f)]) <= bound,
    has_one <-> (1 in range(f)),
    has_two <-> (2 in range(f)),
    !(0 in range(f)),
    !(3 in range(f))
